    "sections": {
        "description": "Activewear Fashion Nook is a WooCommerce fashion store and WordPress block theme for online activewear brands, athleisure boutiques, fitness apparel stores, yoga clothing shops, and modern lifestyle brands building a stylish eCommerce store. With bright, energetic styling, clean modern layouts, and lifestyle-focused photography, it’s perfect for showcasing leggings, sports bras, matching workout sets, performance apparel, sneakers, accessories, and everyday athleisure collections. Built for the WordPress Site Editor, Activewear Fashion Nook includes beautiful patterns, flexible page layouts, and full WooCommerce support to help you create a polished online store with no code. Designed for brands that want to feel confident, modern, and effortlessly active, this theme blends ecommerce functionality with fresh, lifestyle-inspired design."
    },
